          "name": "Requires Frequent Update",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Objects are not necessarily marked as dirty just because they're moving, such as objects attached to other objects.\nIf such objects are spatially filtered they need to update their world locations in order for replication to work as expected.\nUse SetObjectRequiresFrequentWorldLocationUpdate to force frequent world location update on an object."
